Just wanted a quick comment to the original poster ... 

... in the early game, remember that wizards look good in leather.  

Specifically, leather helmet, leather armor, cloak, leather gloves,
elven boots and so on.  All of these decrease your armor class by
quite a bit without interfering with your abilities.  It ain't the
same as wandering around in plate mail but it's definitely better than
walking around in nothing but that stupid cloak you start with.

And of course eventually you'll find crystal plate mail, which is
every bit as good as plate but also doesn't interfere.  It's a good
keeper until you can find dragon scale mail.

